  // had: the clamp below works by moving cents from the wallet ONTO the card, and
  // here there are not enough cents in the charge to reach the floor no matter how
  // they are divided. Previously this fell through and returned whatever sub-floor
  // remainder was left (due 30, balance 10 -> cardCents 20), which Stripe rejects.
